<h1 class="guide-title">Florida Beach Vacation Costs: Compare Your Trip</h1>
<div class="guide-content">
<p>Your Florida beach vacation budget starts with an actual lodging quote for your dates and group. Add meals, transportation and activities before choosing between Bradenton, Sarasota and Anna Maria Island.</p>
<section class="methodology"><strong>Source note — October 5, 2026:</strong> The earlier area-rate estimates and family-trip totals have been removed. Retained price receipts and a reviewed calculation method are not available to substantiate them.</section>
<h2>Compare the complete trip</h2>
<div class="table-wrapper"><table class="data-table"><caption>Costs to compare before booking</caption><thead><tr><th>Expense</th><th>What to include</th><th>Where to get the amount</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Lodging</td><td>Rent, cleaning, taxes, fees and optional extras for the same dates and guest count.</td><td>Final checkout or a written property quote.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Meals</td><td>Groceries, restaurant meals, tips and delivery.</td><td>Current menus and your own meal plan.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Transport</td><td>Flights, bags, rental car or rideshare, fuel, tolls and parking.</td><td>Quotes for your travel dates and current parking information.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Activities</td><td>Admission, equipment hire and tours for your group.</td><td>Current operator pricing and cancellation terms.</td></tr>
</tbody></table></div>
<h2>Bradenton, Sarasota or Anna Maria Island?</h2>
<p>Choose the location around the places you want to visit and the home you need. Neither a fixed area-rate average nor a guaranteed percentage saving can replace a comparison of available listings.</p>
<p>The <a href="/guides/bradenton-vs-sarasota/">Bradenton versus Sarasota comparison</a> explains the location tradeoffs. Seascape's <a href="/properties/">current homes</a> are in Bradenton and Sarasota, with a drive to island beaches.</p>
<h2>Compare booking channels</h2><p>Compare the complete checkout total for the same home, dates and guests. Check cancellation, deposits and optional charges too. <a href="/guides/booking-direct-vacation-rentals/">Direct booking</a> does not guarantee a fixed saving.</p>
<p>For local planning, browse the <a href="/guides/">guides</a>. The <a href="/research/gulf-coast-vacation-booking-trends-2026/">Seascape booking research</a> explains the limits of the earlier study.</p>
